  "description": "Thrills without spills\nLightweight, capable and fun, Whyte Secta 24 takes our award-winning mountain bike expertise and distils it all into an enabling and confidence-inspiring junior hardtail that's perfect for discovering the joys of riding off road on. The overall geometry is reassuringly stable and the components all carefully selected to ensure even new riders can confidently carve turns and ride rough sections like they’ve done it for years. All so every child can enjoy the buzz of fun, freedom and self-belief that comes from mountain biking.\n\nHighlights\n– Ideal for young (7-9 years approx./120cm–140cm tall) riders who are ready to start their off-road journey on a proper mountain bike.\n– Confidence-inspiring, genuine mountain bike geometry and handling.\n– Lightweight 6061 T6 precision formed aluminium frame + Whyte custom rigid fork.\n– Size-specific parts for perfect fit and comfort.\n– Shimano Essa 1x8 (eight-speed) drivetrain (32T chainring x 11-45T cassette).\n– Tektro Junior hydraulic disc brakes with junior levers (160mm rotors front + rear).",
